    "title": "Emmy Noether: Modern LaTeX Working Corpus and Multilingual Translation Drafts (R805 Source-Control Update)",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21247333",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-07",
    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing Emmy Noether working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. This version updates the German/source-control head to R805 and fronts <code>00_Noether_German_Cumulative_Working_SourceControl_R805_20260707.pdf</code>.</p><p><strong>New in this version:</strong> a narrow Paper 19 printed p57 E-family correction packet, <code>08_Noether_SourceRepair_Audit_R805_P19p57_EFamilyCorrection_20260707.zip</code>, containing <code>cum_de_R805.tex</code>/<code>.pdf</code>, source crops, before/after render checks, diff, audit CSVs, compile logs, and stage notes. The earlier R804/v11 source-control packet remains preserved as file <code>07</code>.</p><p><strong>Status caveat:</strong> this is a serious source-repair and translation working corpus, not OCR-only, but it is not a critical edition and not a globally certified final Noether corpus. This R805 update is not Noether closure, not paper-level certification, not whole-corpus source-faithfulness certification, and not multilingual synchronization proof. Filenames containing <code>COMPLETE</code> are inherited local-task labels only.</p><p><strong>GitHub:</strong> corrections, source comparisons, LaTeX fixes, and translation improvements can be suggested via issues or pull requests at <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts</a>.</p>",
